{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"practice-专项-source-4e3835ec030d","kind":"practice","title":"【未上传】综合测评卷(一)（试题word)（可作答题）","year":"专项","region":"资料","variant":"可作答资料","instructions":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"综合测评卷(一)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"时间:100分钟　分值:120分 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"第一部分　阅读(共两节,满分50分)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"第一节　(共15小题;每小题2.5分,满分37.5分)"}]}],"sections":[{"id":"section-legacy","title":"旧卷综合题型","instructions":[],"layout":"flow","groups":[{"id":"group-legacy","instructions":[],"stimulusBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"阅读下列短文,从每题所给的A、B、C、D四个选项中选出最佳选项。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A Wild Child's Guide to Endangered Animals "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"From New York Times best-selling author Millie Marotta comes this gorgeous celebration of the animal kingdom. Highlighting 43 endangered species, the book takes readers on a trip around the world while learning about rare and well-known animals and their habitats."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Marcovaldo"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Marcovaldo is a collection of 20 short stories written by Italo Calvino. Describing the life of a poor rural man living in northern Italy, the stories unfold according to the seasonal cycle of a year. Common themes in the stories include pollution, failure and poverty."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The Art of Mondo"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Over the years, Mondo has received global recognition for its incredible art posters that bring to life classic films, television shows, and comics such as Jurassic Park. For the first time, The Art of Mondo brings together this highly sought-after art in one volume that showcases the incredible creativity of the studio's artists whose vastly different styles are united by one guiding principle:limitless passion for their subject matter."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The Coming of the Third Reich"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no story in 20th-century history more important to understand than Hitler's rise to power and the collapse of civilization in Nazi Germany. The Coming of the Third Reich, by Richard Evans, offers a masterful combination of academic work, important new research and interpretations."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Patriarchy and Capitalism"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Chizuko Ueno, a leading Japanese sociologist, feminist critic and public intellectual, has been a pioneer in women's studies and the author of many books, including Patriarchy and Capitalism."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.Which book will you choose if you are fond of art?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A.Marcovaldo."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"B.The Art of Mondo."}]}],"sharedOptions":[],"questions":[{"id":"q-1","displayNumber":1,"sourceQuestionNumber":1,"type":"single_choice","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Which book will you choose if you are fond of art?"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[{"id":"A","label":"A","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Marcovaldo."}]}]},{"id":"B","label":"B","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The Art of Mondo."}]}]},{"id":"C","label":"C","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The Coming of the Third Reich."}]}]},{"id":"D","label":"D","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Patriarchy and Capitalism."}]}]}],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"auto","kind":"choice","acceptedAnswers":["B"],"norma